[14049]="70060019\n1\tDestroy vile plants at Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy vile plants at Tûr Fúar.\n2\tDestroy vile plants at Tûr Fúar (total: 10)\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy vile plants at Tûr Fúar.\n",
[14050]="70060017\n1\tDestroy vile tomes at Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy vile tomes at Tûr Fúar.\n2\tDestroy vile tomes at Tûr Fúar (total: 12)\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy vile tomes at Tûr Fúar.\n",
[14051]="7005AB04\n1\tDefeat Ugarad the Harbinger\tUgarad the Harbinger can be found somewhere inside Bagud-dum. You should defeat Ugarad the Harbinger.\n2\tHórin can be found outside the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is no longer at Bagud-dum, he can be found at Fellgát.\t\n",
[14052]="70055075\n1\tEnter Bâr Maenath\tBâr Maenath can be found in the western reaches of the Circle of Death. Maendal has asked you to track one of Ugrukhôr's Uruks into Bâr Maenath and defeat it.\n2\tFollow the trail of black blood through Bâr Maenath\tThe trail of blood leads through Bâr Maenath. You discovered a puddle of black blood trailing off into Bâr Maenath. You should follow it and defeat the Uruk that escaped Maendal and his men.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have found Ugrukhôr's uruk slain in Bâr Maenath.\n",
[14053]="70049423\n1\tDefeat Orcs and Uruks at Dâr Mauzur\tOrcs and Uruks can be found at Mauzur. You should defeat as many Orcs and Uruks as possible.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at Dâr Mauzur (total: 10)\030Defeat Uruks at Dâr Mauzur (total: 8)\tOrcs and Uruks can be found at Dâr Mauzur. You should defeat as many Orcs and Uruks as possible.\n3\tCompletado\tDefeated many Orcs and Uruks at Dâr Mauzur.\n",
[14054]="70041D77\n1\tDefeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly\tDefeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly, before he does colossal damage. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[14055]="700428CB\n1\tDefeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly\tDefeat Ugturu the Half-Troll quickly, before he does colossal damage. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n",
[14056]="70048F78\n1\tEncuentra a Uiliúr\tUiliúr se puede encontrar en algún lugar del Ghâshghurm. Deberías despertarlo y derrotarlo.\n2\tDerrota a Uiliúr\tUiliúr se puede encontrar en algún lugar del Ghâshghurm. Deberías despertarlo y derrotarlo.\n3\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a Uiliúr.\n",
[14057]="7006905C\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[14058]="7006905F\n1\tHabla con Rock\tAl completar esta misión, recibirás una asignación de moneda de intercambio de Tâm de Umbar.\n",
[14059]="70068457\n1\tEntrega las garras tocadas por la salmuera en una caja de recolección\030Recoge garras tocadas por la salmuera ([según el diario]/10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras tocadas por la salmuera.\n",
[14060]="7006845A\n1\tEntrega las orejas tocadas por la salmuera en una caja de recolección\030Recoge orejas tocadas por la salmuera ([según el diario]/10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas tocadas por la salmuera.\n",
[14061]="70068459\n1\tEntrega las vainas de alfanje corroídas en una caja de recolección\030Recoge vainas de alfanje corroídas ([según el diario]/10\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de alfanje corroídas.\n",
[14062]="7006845B\n1\tEntrega los montones de masa salada en una caja de recolección\030Recoge montones de masa salada ([según el diario]/10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir masa salada.\n",
[14063]="7006845C\n1\tEntrega las pieles arrojadas por el mar en una caja de recolección\030Recoge pieles arrojadas por el mar ([según el diario]/10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles arrojadas por el mar.\n",
[14064]="700446F0\n1\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. See if Hirluin can remember any of the song.\n2\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n3\tAsk Imadan about the song\030Ask Golasgil about the song\030Ask Aglarang about the song\030Ask Bariel about the song\tImadan, Golasgil, Aglarang, and Bariel can all be found in the Second and Third Circle of Minas Tirith. Speak to the people Forlong named and see if they can remember any of Authlin's song.\n4\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Return to Lord Forlong with what you have learned of the song.\n5\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear to what Hirluin has to say.\n6\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n7\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n8\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear Forlong's reply.\n9\tRetrieve the war trophy\tThe Houses of Lore are in the Fifth Circle. Forlong wants to hold his old war trophy, which is kept in the Houses of Lore.\n10\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Bring the war trophy back to Forlong, in the Merry Swan.\n11\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n12\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n13\tGather knives (total: 12)\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Gather knives from around the Merry Swan so that Hirluin can show how he threw them at corsairs in Umbar.\n14\tBring Hirluin the knives\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Bring the knives to Hirluin, so he can show how he threw them at the Corsairs of Umbar.\n15\tListen to Neldir\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Neldir has to say.\n16\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Listen to Forlong's reply.\n17\tUsa beckon\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Try to beckon as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan. NOTE: This objective requires emotes.\n18\tTalk to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Ask Forlong how your impression came off.\n19\tUsa sigh\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Try to sigh as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan. NOTE: This objective requires emotes.\n20\tTalk to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Ask Forlong how you did with the impression.\n21\tUsa mood_solemn\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Try to make a solemn face (mood_solemn) as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan. NOTE: This objective requires emotes.\n22\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n23\tUsa smoke\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Try to smoke as Thorongil did, in front of Forlong and his friends in the Merry Swan. NOTE: This objective requires emotes.\n24\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n25\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n26\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n27\tListen to Hirluin\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Hirluin has to say.\n28\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n29\tAsk Imadan for another course\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Go tell Imadan the barkeep that Forlong wants another course of food.\n30\tReturn to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Return to Forlong, in the Merry Swan, to tell him food is on its way.\n31\tRaise a glass\tForlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. Raise a glass to friendship with Forlong and company.\n32\tListen to Forlong\tThe Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle. Hear what Forlong has to say.\n",
[14065]="70069D20\n1\tCollect Umbari Tâm (total: 100)\tCollect 100 Umbari Tâm to trade with the Umbar Quartermaster. This quest can be completed weekly.\n2\tTalk to the Umbar Quartermaster to trade Umbari Tâm for Embers. This quest can be completed weekly.\t\n",
[14066]="7002720C\n1\tDaf, Edar, Galvin, Hadun e Idwal viven todos en Barnavon. Gwilum te ha pedido que convoques a los trabajadores Daf, Edar, Galvin, Hadun e Idwal a la mina de Barnavon.\t\n2\tHabla con Gwilum en Barnavon\tGwilum está en la puerta de Barnavon. Debes volver con Gwilum y decirle las respuestas de los trabajadores.\n",
[14067]="7002EF1F\n1\tAcompaña al Thane Béortnoth a Valle del Espino.\tEl Thane Béortnoth está acampado fuera de Valle del Espino. Debes hablar con el Thane Béortnoth cuando estés [según el diario] para asaltar a los orcos en Valle del Espino.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Béortnoth\tEl Thane Béortnoth está acampado fuera de Valle del Espino. Debes hablar con Béortnoth sobre el asalto contra los orcos.\n",
[14068]="7002EF06\n1\tAcompaña al Thane Béortnoth a las ruinas de Valle del Espino\tEl Thane Béortnoth está acampado más allá de los muros de Valle del Espino. Debes hablar con Béortnoth cuando estés [según el diario] para atacar Valle del Espino.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Béortnoth fuera de Valle del Espino\tEl Thane Béortnoth está acampado fuera de las ruinas de Valle del Espino. Debes hablar con Béortnoth sobre el último ataque a Valle del Espino.\n",
[14069]="7001B46E\n1\tEncuentra una sombra en Audaghaim que quiera hablar contigo\tSe pueden encontrar sombras en Audaghaim, al este de la Posada Embrujada en los Troncosombríos. Idhrenfair desea que obtengas información de cualquier sombra en Audaghaim que no sea hostil.\n2\tRegresa junto a Idhrenfair con las pruebas\tEl montaraz Idhrenfair te espera en la Posada Embrujada en los Troncosombríos, al oeste de Audaghaim. Deberías regresar junto a Idhrenfair y transmitirle las palabras de la sombra con la que hablaste.\n",
[14070]="7006BA7A\n1\tCollect Orc battle plans (total: 5)\tGalâmka asked you to retrieve any battle plans you can from the Orcs in Maurûsh.\n2\tReturn to Galâmka with the battle plans\tBring the battle plans back to Galâmka in Ub Nisihir to the north of Maurûsh.\n",
[14071]="70042E96\n1\tCollect Ranger caches (total: 8)\tBâr Húrin is located in Southern Ithilien. You should search rubble piles in Bâr Húrin for buried Ranger supplies.\n2\tDeliver the supplies to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found in the keep at Bâr Húrin. You should talk to Thurindol.\n",
[14072]="7006BF7C\n1\tScout Tûl Zakana from the northern woods below it\030Scout Tûl Zakana from the high rock across the way\030Scout Tûl Zakana from the closer rock outcropping across from it\tScout Tûl Zakana, the Well of Forgetting, from the north, west, and east. Tûl Zakana is far to the east of Dag Usakâra. It can be found south-east of the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi.\n2\tReturn to Usakâr at Dag Usakâra\tReturn to Usakâr at Dag Usakâra with your report.\n",
[14073]="7000EAB1\n1\tUsa Broken Snow Beacon Supply Crate\tEl Kantâ-vilkku está al sur de Sûri-kylä en Jä-rannit, en los ventisqueros sobre la bahía de Forochel. Matti te ha pedido que busques en las cajas rotas signos del animal que atacó el Kantâ-vilkku, lo rastrees y termines con él.\n2\tHabla con Matti\tMatti está en Sûri-kylä, al norte del Kantâ-vilkku. Deberías volver a ver a Matti con las noticias de tu éxito.\n",
[14074]="70066066\n1\tHabla con Dornach\tDervorin would like you to speak to Dornach. Talk to Dornach at the lumber camp, east of Ethring.\n2\tComplete 'New Hires'\030Complete 'Wolves in the Woods'\030Complete 'Ethring Herbs'\030Complete 'Not All at Once'\030Complete 'Not on an Empty Stomach'\tDornach asked you to help folks around the lumber camp. Complete quests in the lumber camp.\n3\tHabla con Dornach\t\n",
[14075]="7004956A\n1\tSversting can likely be found about the forges on the lowest level of the Oath-taker's Horn. Spakorth has asked you to seek his brethren with the Oath-taker's Horn. Since you are entering at the lowest level of the Spire, you should first seek Sversting and see if he might be convinced to abandon Váskmun Greytooth's quest for the dwarf-rings.\t\n2\tFind Dréri\030Find Náth\030Find Freki\tDréri, Náth, and Freki can likely be found on the central level of the Oath-taker's Horn amidst the Firehorn barracks. Sversting proved fiercely loyal to King Greytooth's quest and fought you valiantly. You should now seek Dréri, Náth, and Freki in the Firehorn barracks above.\n3\tEitur can likely be found in Zôreth's chambers on the highest level of the Oath-taker's Horn. You have found all of Spakorth's brethren except for Eitur. You should now seek him and defeat him if need be.\t\n4\tTalk to Spakorth in the Oath-breaker's Horn\tSpakorth can be found in the doorway to Zôreth's chambers alongside Gimli. You have found all of Spakorth's brethren, but unfortunately Sversting and Eitur proved unwilling to abandon their King's quest. You should now speak to Spakorth in the Oath-breaker's Horn.\n",
[14076]="70054F04\n1\tDefeat Cúrongul in the Circle of Death (total: 8)\tCúrongul can be found throughout the Circle of Death in Minas Morgul. You have encountered the Cúrongul, the terrible wardens of Barad Cúron. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many of the Cúrongul patrolling the Circle of Death.\n",
[14077]="70049427\n1\tScout Thorzhaf\030Scout Naerband\030Scout Ennyn Ûr\030Scout Nargroth\030Complete quests in Thorzhaf\030Complete quests in Naerband\030Complete quests in Nargroth\tThorzhaf, Naerband, Ennyn Ûr, and Nargroth can all be found in Talath Úrui. You should scout these locations for Thurindol.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[14078]="7004DA61\n1\tApproach King Thorin III's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain\tKing Thorin III's throne can be found in the rear of the Hall Under the Mountain. You have been asked to join Gimli before King Thorin's throne in Erebor.\n2\tTalk to Gimli before King Thorin III's throne\tGimli is standing before King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have approached King Thorin's throne and found Gimli waiting patiently. You should speak to him.\n",
[14079]="70049573\n1\tDefeat Order of the Eye seekers in Barad-dûr (total: 6)\030Defeat Order of the Eye torturers in Barad-dûr (total: 6)\030Defeat an Order of the Eye warden in Barad-dûr\tSeekers, torturers, and wardens of the Order of the Eye can be found throughout the ruins of Barad-dûr. While searching for Váskmun Greytooth in the ruins of Barad-dûr, you have discovered a large assemblage of cultists serving the Order of the Eye. You should defeat them.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have stood firm against the Order of the Eye in Barad-dûr, and defeated many of their number.\n",
[14080]="70041859\n1\tDefeat encroaching Corsairs outside Ost Anglebed (total: 6)\tCorsairs can be found to the south and east of Ost Anglebed. Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat Corsairs that have crossed the Serni before they can invade Ost Anglebed.\n2\tTalk to Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed. You have defeated many Corsairs outside Ost Anglebed and weakened their advance across the river Serni.\n",
})
